race-class-combos covered by DISABLE_SIGNATURE_CHECKS, rce-security-fix / large-address-aware
meaningless on x64, nameplate-cast-bars and ghost-attack-fix dropped (mis-addressed patches).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ByrZ7GxoHC9wfGdkRwtqCX
